  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scarab
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  vesselClass: 12
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Ball Generation
    AbilityDescription: Charge lowers the crystal energy required to materialise a
      ball (authored on the ball-forge effect when the Astro League mode pass lands;
      generic map multiplier stays 1.0). Collect crystals to fill the energy meter;
      at the threshold the next crystal contact becomes a ball carrying your
      velocity. L5 upgrade awaits markup (SCARAB.md section 7).
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel:
    UpgradeDescription:
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Switch
    AbilityDescription: Mass grows the switch structure - ring aperture and panel
      span (authored on PlaceSwitchActionSO.switchScale ElementalFloat, x1 -> x2.5
      at level 10; generic map multiplier stays 1.0 to avoid double-dipping). L5
      upgrade awaits markup.
    Input: 6
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel:
    UpgradeDescription:
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: (open design slot)
    AbilityDescription: 'Space is deliberately unassigned - the design notes name
      Charge/Mass/Time only. Proposed: juke displacement + hit reach, leaving drift
      as unmapped base kit (the Sparrow-roll precedent). Do not fill without
      markup (SCARAB.md section 7).'
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel:
    UpgradeDescription:
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Throttle
    AbilityDescription: Time raises the top speed of the throttle ramp (authored on
      the transformer's ThrottleScalerMultiplier ElementalFloat, x1 -> x1.5 at
      level 10; the generic map Time multiplier stays 1.0 - the no-double-dip pin).
      The L5 Snap Dash double-tap is wired in ScarabVesselTransformer and gates on
      IsUpgradeActive(Time); its label awaits markup.
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel:
    UpgradeDescription:
